<title>POLAND: Kety to vote on stock split Dec 23.</title>
<headline>Kety to vote on stock split Dec 23.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Zaklady Metali Lekkich Kety SA (Kety) said on Tuesday it was planning a stock split.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and senior officials at the firm were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Management's proposal must be approved by an extraordinary shareholders meeting on December 23.</p>
<p>Kety, which has 2,500,195 shares outstanding, closed on the bourse's main market on Tuesday at 210 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
